-- src:95 | shall in each case be increased by 3.8 per cent.
@ref art 6(3)(b) (src:90-95)
GIVEN `the amount of a transitional rate state pension that exceeds the full rate` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`art 6(3)(b): the excess over the full rate after the increase of 3.8 per cent` `the amount of a transitional rate state pension that exceeds the full rate` MEANS
    `the amount of a transitional rate state pension that exceeds the full rate` TIMES (1 PLUS 3.8%)

-- out of text: Pensions Act 2014 Sch 4 paras 5(3) and 6: the amount above the full rate before the Order is an input.
-- src:90 | (3) The amounts which, under—
-- src:93 | (c) paragraphs 5(3) and 6 of Schedule 4 to the Pensions Act, are the amounts of survivor’s pensions which either alone or in combination with one or more other pensions under Part 1 of that Act exceed the full rate; and
-- src:95 | shall in each case be increased by 3.8 per cent.
@ref art 6(3)(c) (src:90-95)
GIVEN `the amount of a survivor's pension that exceeds the full rate, alone or with other pensions` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`art 6(3)(c): the survivor's pension excess over the full rate after the increase of 3.8 per cent` `the amount of a survivor's pension that exceeds the full rate, alone or with other pensions` MEANS
    `the amount of a survivor's pension that exceeds the full rate, alone or with other pensions` TIMES (1 PLUS 3.8%)

-- out of text: Pensions Act 2014 Sch 9 paras 5(3) and 6: the amount above the full rate before the Order is an input.
-- src:90 | (3) The amounts which, under—
-- src:94 | (d) paragraphs 5(3) and 6 of Schedule 9 to the Pensions Act, are the amounts of shared state pensions under Part 1 of the Pensions Act which either alone or in combination with one or more other pensions under Part 1 of that Act exceed the full rate,
-- src:95 | shall in each case be increased by 3.8 per cent.
@ref art 6(3)(d) (src:90-95)
GIVEN `the amount of a shared state pension that exceeds the full rate, alone or with other pensions` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`art 6(3)(d): the shared state pension excess over the full rate after the increase of 3.8 per cent` `the amount of a shared state pension that exceeds the full rate, alone or with other pensions` MEANS
    `the amount of a shared state pension that exceeds the full rate, alone or with other pensions` TIMES (1 PLUS 3.8%)

DECLARE `an amount that art 6(3) increases` IS ONE OF
    `a survivor's pension based on inheritance of deferred old state pension (section 9)`
    `the amount of a transitional rate state pension above the full rate (Schedule 2 paragraph 4(3))`
    `the amount of a survivor's pension above the full rate (Schedule 4 paragraphs 5(3) and 6)`
    `the amount of a shared state pension above the full rate (Schedule 9 paragraphs 5(3) and 6)`
    `an amount not described in art 6(3)`

-- out of text: Pensions Act 2014 ss 9 and Schs 2, 4, 9 (the amounts art 6(3) lists): the amount before the Order is an input.
@ref art 6(3) (src:90-95)
GIVEN `which amount` IS A `an amount that art 6(3) increases`
      `the amount before the increase` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`art 6(3): the amount after the increase of 3.8 per cent` `which amount` `the amount before the increase` MEANS
    CONSIDER `which amount`
    WHEN `a survivor's pension based on inheritance of deferred old state pension (section 9)` THEN JUST (`art 6(3)(a): the section 9 survivor's pension after the increase of 3.8 per cent` `the amount before the increase`)
    WHEN `the amount of a transitional rate state pension above the full rate (Schedule 2 paragraph 4(3))` THEN JUST (`art 6(3)(b): the excess over the full rate after the increase of 3.8 per cent` `the amount before the increase`)
    WHEN `the amount of a survivor's pension above the full rate (Schedule 4 paragraphs 5(3) and 6)` THEN JUST (`art 6(3)(c): the survivor's pension excess over the full rate after the increase of 3.8 per cent` `the amount before the increase`)
    WHEN `the amount of a shared state pension above the full rate (Schedule 9 paragraphs 5(3) and 6)` THEN JUST (`art 6(3)(d): the shared state pension excess over the full rate after the increase of 3.8 per cent` `the amount before the increase`)
    OTHERWISE NOTHING
